        "slc_c81071e2ff251283cfdf5593e3c9c1db3d30656f3a534af43ae7ac3ef0c9affb"
      ],
      "text": "The README suggests optional .vimrc mappings that bind Ctrl+x in normal and insert mode to trigger CreateCompletion."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2ca2caae6903491ca44337e87c7138aa31a614a2b859679db82aecc6cba143f9",
